      "label": "legend_0050_legend_07",
      "hash64": "3A8B49EA1CD0D7A8",
      "text": "啊嗄嘶……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "legend_0050_friend_14",
      "hash64": "F0558F89AF8223AF",
      "text": "身體看起來很健康，\\n會不會是有什麼精神上的理由，\\r\\n讓牠無法恢復成原本的樣子呢？[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "legend_0050_select_03",
      "hash64": "CD0CFF4801CC6967",
      "text": "精神上的理由？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "legend_0050_select_04",
      "hash64": "CD0CFC4801CC644E",
      "text": "什麼意思？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "legend_0050_friend_15",
      "hash64": "F0558E89AF8221FC",
      "text": "內心的傷痕……所謂的心靈創傷嗎？\\n我曾經在書上看過。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "legend_0050_friend_19",
      "hash64": "F0559289AF8228C8",
      "text": "或許牠曾經在對戰時有過恐怖的體驗，\\n結果變得害怕對戰了……？[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "legend_0050_friend_16",
      "hash64": "F0559189AF822715",
      "text": "……不過！我相信那傢伙和獒教父\\n有一天都會完全恢復的！[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "legend_0050_friend_17",
      "hash64": "F0559089AF822562",
      "text": "獒教父，\\n這次調味料的效果如何呢……！？[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "legend_0050_mastiff_03",
      "hash64": "451820484C662F95",
      "text": "……哇呼。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "legend_0050_friend_18",
      "hash64": "F0559389AF822A7B",
      "text": "啊，抱歉抱歉。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
