      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "legend_0050_friend_28",
      "hash64": "F04B9189AF79D290",
      "text": "的確不是每次都\\n一定能恢復活力的嘛～[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "legend_0050_friend_29",
      "hash64": "F04B9289AF79D443",
      "text": "效果也不一定馬上就會出現。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
